# Conformance probe pack for `absent` with `iscale` on the `json` wire
# (spec 0.15, ruling 6). Public. No kinds. One member. The sentinels are
# compared as canonical text (ruling 9 of 0.9), through a double (ruling 19
# of 0.9), whatever the transform: `1e2` and `100.0` match `100`, and
# 9007199254740993 is held as 9007199254740992, so the wire number
# 9007199254740992 matches it. An absent key writes the first sentinel, 100.
format  conformance-transforms-json-absent
version 0.15.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   probe.cnt  cnt  iscale:1/2  absent 100,9007199254740993
